...@../../../dev/d2/themes/sequence
# W10: continuation of the same synchronous callback in W02, not a fresh attempt.
shape: sequence_diagram
coord: Rust coordinator
scheme: Scheme owner
ledger: Admission ledger
broker: Rust broker
upstream: Upstream service
coord -> coord: Continue the original callback\nConsumption is verified
coord -> ledger: S4: CAS against current state\nPreserve audit and holds
ledger -> coord: Commit SendCommitted\nAdvance this attempt from V to V+1
broker -> coord: S5: claim the exact attempt
coord -> ledger: CAS against current premises and fence
ledger -> coord: Confirm one durable claim
coord -> broker: Issue one local send handle
broker -> broker: Check bytes, target and credentials\nEnforce the deadline
broker -> upstream: Start one application request\nNo hidden retry, redirect or mirror
broker -> coord: Confirm the attributable emitter is closed\nNo future application submissions
upstream -> broker: Return the selected attributable result\nReport usage
broker -> coord: S6: bind outcome and usage evidence
coord -> ledger: Deduplicate the observations
coord -> ledger: Settle the budget atomically\nUse admitted evidence only
coord -> scheme: Return the callback result\nFollow the capability acknowledgment contract
scheme -> coord: Return a non-durable lifecycle receipt\nGrant no new dispatch right
coord.caveat: "W02 and W10 share one attempt: never issue or consume the grant again.\nThis is one permitted result order; W07 separates emitter closure, outcome and settlement."
coord.class: runtime
scheme.class: semantic
ledger.class: ledger
broker.class: runtime
upstream.class: ledger
coord.caveat.class: note

